<title>BELGIUM: Salomon Bros rates PetroFina underperform.</title>
<headline>Salomon Bros rates PetroFina underperform.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of research report -</p>
<p>Co name-----------Sector------Price------Broker-------------</p>
<p>    PetroFina	   oil	   11,925 *   Salomon Brothers</p>
<p>COMMENT: Reduce sector weightings by taking profits. Share looks exposed from a valuation point of view. Salomon believes a modest decline in earnings is likely in 1997 as a result of weaker crude prices since the exploration and production division provided over 60 percent of 1996 operating income. It sees 1995-99 compound EPS growth of around nine percent.</p>
<p>Analysts: Jeremy Hudson, Gordon Gray.</p>
<p>(*) on Jan 31; date of research report Feb 10.</p>
<p> Investment code    12-mth price target	12-mth total return</p>
<p> Feb 10    Nov 6*   Feb 10	  Nov 6	Feb 10	  Nov 6</p>
<p> U/perf    U/perf   10,500	  9,000	(8.5)	   (3.7)</p>
<p>(* data of previous report)</p>
